<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14396" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπραξία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>non-action,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μέλλον ἴσον ἀπραξίᾳ λέγω</span>
			intending to act is the same as <i>not-acting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				426
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδεμίαν . . πρᾶξιν οὐδ᾽ ἀπραξίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					262c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rest from business, leisure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Men.
				633
			</span></i>: in pl., = Lat. <i>justitium,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>want of success,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινὴ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.188
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl.,
				<i>futilities,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.38S.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
